# Kod 9940 — MAX7219 LED only

Standalone project in `max7219_led/`. No GPS, no BMP280, no OLED.

- Deploy: `max7219_led/9940.bat`
- Bitstream: `max7219_led.bin` (3-bit AXI GPIO, pins 11/13/15)
- Run: `bash ~/max7219_led/start.sh` or `sudo python3 display.py`
- Build bitstream: `max7219_led/vivado/run_build.bat`

Mutually exclusive overlay with 9928/9930 (only one FPGA design loaded at a time).
